  "triage_steps": [
    "Scope it: list every system that runs the vulnerable software (within 2 hours of the KEV listing)",
    "Preserve evidence before patching: memory, running processes, network connections and logs, since patching can destroy them (2 to 24 hours)",
    "Contain: isolate or restrict access to the affected systems, then patch (6 to 24 hours)",
    "Analyse the evidence for signs of compromise: unknown accounts or keys, new services or scheduled jobs, odd outbound connections (24 to 48 hours)",
